      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-11T18:35:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We shouldn\u0027t necessarily need to go this far to make SkResourceCache thread safe.  If there was a resource cache per Recorder, they would be able to be unguarded.  We would just explicitly lock access to the hidden default Recorder/Context during client migration.\n\nIf the cache will be on the Context and shared by all recorders, then it makes sense for this to be internally thread safe.",
